</description><link>https://www.ifanr.com/digest/1653633</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ifanr-digest-1653633</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 11:39:51 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Clawdbot 零基础接入钉钉，手把手教你把私人 AI 搬到聊天</title><description>&lt;p&gt;Moltbot 是近期推出的现象级开源 Agent 项目，原名 Clawdbot，用户无需打开网站或 App，通过通讯软件即可发送消息并执行任务。该项目的部署方式已成为全球用户关注的焦点，海外社交媒体甚至涌现大量用户购买 Mac mini 来本地部署。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在国内，阿里云、腾讯云等云厂商也陆续提供 Moltbot 云服务，作为工作场景的首推入口，钉钉也在 Github 上开源了 Moltbot 接入方式。用户在终端用钉钉发送命令，Moltbot 即可自动在云端执行任务，这也意味着人人都能拥有一个专属的工作 AI 助手。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653536&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/1-10.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2672&quot; height=&quot;1540&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/1-10.png!720 2672w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/1-10-360x207.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/1-10-768x443.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/1-10-1024x590.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2672px) 100vw, 2672px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Github 地址：&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/DingTalk-Real-AI/dingtalk-moltbot-connector&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://github.com/DingTalk-Real-AI/dingtalk-moltbot-connector&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;一、钉钉机器人配置&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;第一步：如何申请钉钉机器人&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;打开 &lt;a href=&quot;https://open.dingtalk.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;钉钉开放平台&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;登录后进入 &lt;strong&gt;应用开发&lt;/strong&gt;→ &lt;strong&gt;企业内部开发&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;创建应用，选择 &lt;strong&gt;机器人&lt;/strong&gt;类型&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653537&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2-8.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2920&quot; height=&quot;1374&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2-8.png!720 2920w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2-8-360x169.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2-8-768x361.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/2-8-1024x482.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2920px) 100vw, 2920px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;在应用详情页获取 &lt;strong&gt;AppKey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;和 &lt;strong&gt;AppSecret&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;配置机器人的消息接收模式为 &lt;strong&gt;Stream 模式&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653538&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-7.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2606&quot; height=&quot;1910&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-7.png!720 2606w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-7-360x264.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-7-768x563.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/3-7-1024x751.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2606px) 100vw, 2606px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;发布钉钉机器人&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653539&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/4-8.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2156&quot; height=&quot;1866&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/4-8.png!720 2156w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/4-8-360x312.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/4-8-768x665.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/4-8-1024x886.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2156px) 100vw, 2156px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;第二步：钉钉企业应用权限开通（非管理员用户需管理员审批）&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;逐个搜索打开下列权限&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Card.Streaming.Write&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Card.Instance.Write&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;qyapi_robot_sendmsg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653540&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/5-5.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;3358&quot; height=&quot;1458&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/5-5.png!720 3358w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/5-5-360x156.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/5-5-768x333.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/5-5-1024x445.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 3358px) 100vw, 3358px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;第三步：发布企业应用&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653541&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/6-5.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;3074&quot; height=&quot;1468&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/6-5.png!720 3074w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/6-5-360x172.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/6-5-768x367.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/6-5-1024x489.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 3074px) 100vw, 3074px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653542&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/7-6.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2850&quot; height=&quot;1348&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/7-6.png!720 2850w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/7-6-360x170.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/7-6-768x363.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/7-6-1024x484.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2850px) 100vw, 2850px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653543&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8-4.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2126&quot; height=&quot;1728&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8-4.png!720 2126w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8-4-360x293.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8-4-768x624.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/8-4-1024x832.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2126px) 100vw, 2126px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653544&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9-2.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1096&quot; height=&quot;474&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9-2.png!720 1096w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9-2-360x156.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9-2-768x332.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/9-2-1024x443.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1096px) 100vw, 1096px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;确认可见范围仅自己，启用了机器人后，点&lt;strong&gt;发布&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;第四步：钉钉机器人使用 Moltbot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;如需通过钉钉机器人使用 Moltbot，需要配置以下变量：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;SahwKEE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_697b21bf526db.png!720&quot; rel=&quot;lightbox[1653533]&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;alignnone size-full wp-image-1653555 &quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_697b21bf526db.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_697b21bf526db.png!720 1586w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_697b21bf526db-360x34.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_697b21bf526db-768x73.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/img_697b21bf526db-1024x97.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1586px) 100vw, 1586px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653545&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10-4.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;2024&quot; height=&quot;1010&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10-4.png!720 2024w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10-4-360x180.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10-4-768x383.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/10-4-1024x511.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 2024px) 100vw, 2024px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;二、 Moltbot 配置（如不能放外链，可删除）&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;官网 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.molt.bot/&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://www.molt.bot/&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;按 moltbot 官网介绍，配置好moltbot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653546&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11-6.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1778&quot; height=&quot;542&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11-6.png!720 1778w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11-6-360x110.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11-6-768x234.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/11-6-1024x312.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1778px) 100vw, 1778px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moltbot配置文档&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.molt.bot/start/getting-started&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://docs.molt.bot/start/getting-started&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;安装Moltbot技能&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://clawdhub.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;https://clawdhub.com/&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moltbot中其他设置和功能可以自行探索&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653547&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12-5.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1780&quot; height=&quot;1002&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12-5.png!720 1780w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12-5-360x203.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12-5-768x432.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/12-5-1024x576.png 1024w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1780px) 100vw, 1780px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;三&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;、将机器人接入 moltbot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;按 moltbot 官网介绍，配置好 moltbot 后，安装插件和钉钉机器人&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. 安装插件&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;# 远程安装&lt;br&gt;
clawdbot plugins install https://github.com/DingTalk-Real-AI/dingtalk-moltbot-connector.git&lt;br&gt;
# 后续插件升级&lt;br&gt;
clawdbot plugins update dingtalk-connector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. 配置&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在 ~/.moltbot/moltbot.json（或 ~/.clawdbot/clawdbot.json）中添加：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;{&lt;br&gt;
“channels”: {&lt;br&gt;
“dingtalk”: {&lt;br&gt;
“enabled”: true,&lt;br&gt;
“clientId”: “dingxxxxxxxxx”, &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;// 钉钉 AppKey&lt;br&gt;
“clientSecret”: “your_secret_here”, // 钉钉 AppSecret&lt;br&gt;
“gatewayToken”: “”, &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;// 可选：Gateway 认证 token&lt;br&gt;
“gatewayPassword”: “”, &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;// 可选：Gateway 认证 password（与 token 二选一）&lt;br&gt;
“sessionTimeout”: 1800000, &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;// 可选：会话超时(ms)，默认 30 分钟&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;br&gt;
},&lt;br&gt;
“gateway”: {&lt;br&gt;
“http”: {&lt;br&gt;
“endpoints”: {&lt;br&gt;
“chatCompletions”: {&lt;br&gt;
“enabled”: true&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;br&gt;
}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;或者在 Moltbot Dashboard 页面配置&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653548&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13-4.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1880&quot; height=&quot;2016&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13-4.png!720 1880w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13-4-360x386.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13-4-768x824.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/13-4-955x1024.png 955w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1880px) 100vw, 1880px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. 重启 Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;clawdbot gateway restart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;验证：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;clawdbot plugins list &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;# 确认 dingtalk-connector 已加载&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;四、跟Moltbot聊天方式&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;配置好钉钉环境变量后，可以在钉钉中搜索&lt;strong&gt;你设定的机器人名&lt;/strong&gt;进行对话。一些场景展示：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653549&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/14-3.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;784&quot; height=&quot;912&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/14-3.png!720 784w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/14-3-360x419.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/14-3-768x893.png 768w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 784px) 100vw, 784px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653550&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/15-2.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;708&quot; height=&quot;843&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/15-2.png!720 708w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/15-2-360x429.png 360w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 708px) 100vw, 708px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653551&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/16-2.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;521&quot; height=&quot;1128&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/16-2.png!720 521w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/16-2-360x779.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/16-2-473x1024.png 473w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 521px) 100vw, 521px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653552&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/17-1.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;522&quot; height=&quot;1138&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/17-1.png!720 522w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/17-1-360x785.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/17-1-470x1024.png 470w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 522px) 100vw, 522px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653553&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-1.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1290&quot; height=&quot;2796&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-1.png!720 1290w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-1-360x780.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-1-768x1665.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-1-472x1024.png 472w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1290px) 100vw, 1290px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;aligncenter size-full wp-image-1653554&quot; src=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/19-1.png!720&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1290&quot; height=&quot;2796&quot; srcset=&quot;https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/19-1.png!720 1290w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/19-1-360x780.png 360w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/19-1-768x1665.png 768w, https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/19-1-472x1024.png 472w&quot; sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1290px) 100vw, 1290px&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;特性：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;流式响应（打字机效果）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;支持图片显示（自动上传到钉钉）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;支持 Markdown 格式&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description><link>https://www.ifanr.com/digest/1653533</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ifanr-digest-1653533</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 09:03:44 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>小米 SU7 Ultra 加入《GT 赛车》</title><description>&lt;p&gt;小米 SU7 Ultra 加入《GT 赛车》，成首款收录的中国车型&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;昨天，小米集团 CEO 雷军在微博发文，官宣小米 SU7 Ultra 量产版正式加入《Gran Turismo 7》（GT 赛车 7），成为该系列近三十年历史中首款来自中国的车型。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;据悉，《GT 赛车》以严苛的选车标准著称，其「驾照中心」与「品牌中心」机制长期被视……全文： http://m.weibo.cn/1642720480/5260467867485440 ……&lt;/p&gt;
</description><link>https://www.ifanr.com/digest/1653535</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ifanr-digest-1653535</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 08:53:27 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>